    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "GWD are delighted to present to the market No. 5 Great Western Avenue a redbrick period style 3 bedroom end of terrace property. Built in the late 1800s this property is situated in a quiet and tranquil area just off North Circular Road and Phibsborough Road. Accommodation: Storm porch, 2 receptions, breakfast room, small extended kitchen, 3 bedrooms, bathroom & WC upstairs, outside WC and boiler room. c. 90 sq/mts. Double glazing. Gas fire radiator central heating. Rewired. Alarm. BER E2. Small Garden to front, 2 yards to rear with access from side and great potential for private parking. Viewing by appointment only. Contact Brian Daly, SCSI, 0862357340"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation\t\r\nStorm Porch\r\n\t\t\r\nEntrance Hall\t4.10m x 1.8m\t\r\n\r\nFront Reception\t3.90m x 3.85m\tFeature fireplace. \r\n\r\nBack Reception\t3.90m x 3.60m\tFeature fireplace. \r\n\r\nBreakfast Room\t2.60m x 2.20m\t\r\n\r\nKitchen\t2.60m  2.34m\t\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\t4.50m x 3.40m\tDouble bedroom. Feature fireplace.\r\n     \r\nBedroom 2\t3.30m x 3.10m\tDouble bedroom. Feature fireplace.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\t3.10m x 2.50m\tSingle bedroom. Built in wardrobes\r\n\r\nBathroom & WC\t2.40m x 1.80m\tShower, wc and wash hand basin\t\r\n\t\t\r\nOutside\t6.00m  8.40m\tOutside WC/Boiler Room. 2 yards with entrance to both from the side."
